  "conclusion": "Starting the real SDK acquisition before Android Daily timer replacement leaves its old-registry timeout alive after fulfillment. Initializing Daily before the operation prevents this reproduced mismatch without changing the SDK lock, timeout, result or callback count. iOS does not replace these globals.",
